## 4. Core entities

| Entity | What it is |
|---|---|
| **Job** | One user request: F, C, status, result |
| **File** | One generated file of C random numbers (values in 0–1) |
| **Task** | One unit of work for a worker: *generate up to 5 files*, or *combine up to 5 items* |
| **Item** | Something waiting to be combined: a raw file or a partial result. It holds a **list of C sums** (one per position) and a **count** of how many files it represents. A raw file is an item with count = 1. |
| **Worker** | A Python process that takes one task at a time from the queue. There are **W workers for the whole system**, shared by all jobs; they wait idle until a task appears. |

